* Silver Sword can also be upgraded at the [[Forge of Potential]] with a [[Silver Battle Idol]].

== Notes ==
* The [[Damage#Spirit|Spirit damage]] on the weapon only affects [[Factions|undead]] and demon enemies. This makes higher physical damage dealing swords such as the [[Black Metal Sword]] better for general use.
* Spirit damage is not instant damage, but a ticking (and stacking) debuff like fire.
* Silver sword has currently the highest Spirit damage of any weapon in the game. 

